Copied code: carrier-affine virtual thread scheduler

looma contains a copy of code under the Java package io.netty.loom
(and its .scheduler.jfr and .topology subpackages), inside the netty-loom-scheduler
module (see netty-loom-scheduler/README.md for the exact directories and the refresh
procedure), from:

  Project:  Netty VirtualThread Scheduler
  Origin:   https://github.com/franz1981/Netty-VirtualThread-Scheduler
  Commit:   7e712d8ae96baa7bfc904e3527d119a5b3ac60f9
  Packages: io.netty.loom.scheduler.* (module "bootstrap")
            io.netty.loom.topology.LinuxCarrierTopology (module "topology")
  License:  Apache License, Version 2.0
            https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

Copyright 2025-2026 The Netty VirtualThread Scheduler Project

In accordance with Apache License, Version 2.0, Section 4(b): these files are a copy
of the originals at the commit above, unmodified except for three files:

  io/netty/loom/scheduler/EventLoopScheduler.java -- modified by the Looma project to
  add a per-carrier "home queue" that work stealing never reads, and a factory for
  virtual threads queued on it.
  io/netty/loom/scheduler/IdleCarrierTracker.java -- modified by the Looma project so
  that the idle carrier woken to steal is found by a scan from a random member, not
  always from the first.
  io/netty/loom/scheduler/NettyScheduler.java -- modified by the Looma project so
  that the JDK's pollers start before the carriers, and are not kept on the one CPU
  of the carrier that would have started them.

Each file says so at its top, every change in it is marked "Looma:", and the complete
diff against the originals is netty-loom-scheduler/looma-home-queue.patch.

No other package, class, system property, JFR event name or test body was altered.
The netty-loom-scheduler module reaches this code through a separate adapter,
io.github.pderop.looma.scheduler.netty, which is this project's own code and is
not part of this copy.

The original Apache-2.0 copyright header is preserved at the top of each copied file,
in addition to this NOTICE.
